# Centurion Remote iOS — Locked Design Rules

Read `ios/CenturionApp/DESIGN_RULES.md` for full rationale. Enforce these on every iOS change.

## Audience
Successful adults 50+, non-technical, newly self-directed with personal AI. They must feel **calm and capable**, never like they're using a developer console.

## Apple Design Award lens (2025–2026)
Ship work that could score in: Delight, Inclusivity, Innovation, Interaction, Social Impact, Visuals. Innovation = native private Centurion link + mission-centered companion, not feature sprawl.

## Non-negotiables

### Language (default surfaces)
- Say: "Your Centurion", "private connection", "working on now", "needs your choice", "documents"
- **Mission** = the human (life purpose, commitments, About You context)
- **Soul** = the Centurion (AI personality, tone, rules — not the human profile)
- Never: Remote Control, LLM/provider/model, agent/sub-agent, loop phase, Bonjour/mDNS, crypto algorithm names, filesystem paths
- Never duplicate mission language in Soul surfaces or AI personality language in Mission surfaces

### Typography & touch
- Body copy: semantic styles (`.body`, `.headline`) — supports Dynamic Type
- No fixed sizes below 15pt for readable content; never 6–10pt operational labels on default UI
- Minimum 44×44pt tap targets
- Honor `accessibilityReduceMotion` for orbital/loop/splash animations

### Visual system
- Colors/spacing/motion from `ColorTheme`, `Spacing`, `Motion` in DesignSystem/CenturionTheme
- Cards: `.cardStyle()` — do not duplicate card chrome
- Remote/Pulse/Security: `TabPageChrome` without BrandHeader
- Serif for mission/editorial only; sans for actions

### Simplicity & IA
- One primary action per screen; advanced/technical behind progressive disclosure
- Max 3 concepts above the fold
- Pulse categories map to human outcomes: Working on now / Finished / Documents / Needs your choice / Updates
- Security/crypto details collapsed by default

### Workflows
- No preview data presented as live — label demo mode explicitly
- Errors need visible message + retry (not haptic-only)
- Tab switches must not reset conversation, forms, or navigation stacks
- Mission Discovery: one clear Save path; Share is optional
- Offline/disconnected states must block or clearly label simulated responses

### Haptics
- Meaningful transitions only — never per-keystroke in text fields

## Anti-patterns (block PR)
Fixed tiny fonts, hardcoded fake live data, LLM dial on main Connect for new users, duplicate Security+Settings crypto essays, nested share sheets, unreachable broken flows (Quick Chat selection), Mission/Soul copy overlap (human mission in Soul screen)

## Pre-merge checklist
- [ ] Plain-language copy on new strings
- [ ] Dynamic Type spot-check on changed screens
- [ ] VoiceOver labels on new controls
- [ ] Uses design tokens, not raw magic numbers/colors
